{"id":1776,"level":71,"name":"Взяття чи мат?","group":"Мат","format":27,"description":"<p>If you spot an undefended piece, you would be a fool not to take it. A free piece, that earns you points!</p><p>However, it is always wise to look a little further. Because maybe there is a chance to checkmate.&nbsp;And that, of course, is even better.</p><p><br></p><h3>What do you have to do?</h3><p>Play the best move: Do you capture a piece or can you checkmate the king?</p>","assignment":"","stickerID":51,"examples":[{"fen":"5r2/r3N1pk/8/3R4/pq6/P7/1PP3P1/1K6 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[#]} 1. Rh5# ! *","text":"<p>Чорний ферзь незахищений.<br />Білий може взяти ферзя своїм пішаком.<br />Вільна фігура, яке щастя!</p> <p>Утім, є ще кращий хід.<br />Ви бачите його?</p> <p>Якщо білі пересувають туру на h5 (Rd5-h5#) це мат!</p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":74623,"fen":"6k1/5ppp/r7/p1pn4/P7/2q2Q2/5PPP/1R4K1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%evp 0,1,29999,-30000]} {[#]} {Q=1} 1. Rb8# ! *","format":27,"texts":["Мат!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":74662,"fen":"4rrk1/1R5R/3q1np1/5p2/5P2/2P2B2/2b2PKP/2Q5 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[#]} {Q=1} 1. Rbg7# ! *","format":27,"texts":["Мат!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":74633,"fen":"2k5/pp4pq/2b2p2/P5B1/2PN4/6P1/1R3P2/R5K1 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%evp 0,1,-29999,-30000]} {[#]} {Q=1} 1... Qh1# ! *","format":27,"texts":["Мат!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":74631,"fen":"2k5/pp3pNr/2b2n2/P7/2P5/4B1P1/1R3P2/R5K1 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%evp 0,1,-29999,-30000]} {[#]} {Q=1} 1... Rh1# ! *","format":27,"texts":["Мат!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":74663,"fen":"8/5Bkp/8/1Pp2p2/2P2P2/6P1/1r5r/3R1RK1 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[#]} {Q=1} 1... Rbg2# ! *","format":27,"texts":["Мат!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":74626,"fen":"r4rk1/1p3ppp/2pb4/p5Nq/P1P5/8/1BQ2PPP/1R3RK1 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%evp 0,1,-29999,-30000]} {[#]} {Q=1} 1... Qxh2# ! *","format":27,"texts":["Мат!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":